        "text": "Notice the massive divergence in resource efficiency, Kaito. An asynchronous Scrapy crawler handles 5,000 requests per second on 45 megabytes of RAM. But if you spin up headless Chromium for pages that don't need client-side JavaScript, your throughput plunges by ninety-nine percent while consuming ten gigabytes of memory!",
