        "text": "Look at the generative annotation pipeline on Slide 2. Data engineering teams begin with task specifications and constitutional rubrics. Teacher models generate candidate reasoning traces, which are then passed through two parallel branches: self-consistency reasoning marginalization and LLM-as-a-judge preference pools.",
