            "text": "Whoa! Wait—2.38 is independent of delta! Whether the broken sensors emit 500 degrees or 1 billion degrees, they warp sigma proportionally so their Z-score hits a hard ceiling of 2.38, which is strictly below 3.0!",
            "dock": "main",
            "start": 136.032,
