            "text": "Wait—a 90% True Positive Rate paired with a 1% False Positive Rate gives a gorgeous ROC-AUC above 0.95! Yet doctors still have to audit 1,000 false alarms for just 90 positive hits—precision is under 9%!",
            "dock": "main",
            "start": 513.72,
