        "text": "Rule 1: Always filter analog signals before the ADC to eliminate aliasing. Rule 2: Size ADC bits for required signal dynamic range using the 6.02 dB per bit rule. Rule 3: Use binary MQTT or CoAP headers to avoid cellular data inflation. Rule 4: Enforce edge deadband suppression to guarantee multi-year battery longevity.",
