        "text": "A Datasheet documents seven essential lifecycle dimensions: Motivation, Composition, Collection Process, Preprocessing, Uses, Distribution, and Maintenance. It creates an immutable provenance trail for compliance audits and prevents unsafe data reuse across incompatible domains.",
