        "slideIndex": 7,
        "turn": 13,
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Moving from graphical perception to statistical hygiene, we confront the multiplicity crisis. In modern big data EDA, analysts routinely screen hundreds or thousands of feature correlations and group differences.",
