        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "The Benjamini-Hochberg algorithm operates through a step-up ranking procedure. First, sort all m p-values in ascending order. Then define a dynamic critical threshold line: T sub i equals i divided by m, multiplied by target FDR Q-star.",
