        "text": "Definition 12.2.3 introduces the RUM Conjecture by Athanassoulis and colleagues. Every storage engine operates on a strict zero-sum Pareto frontier bounded by Read Overhead R, Update Overhead U, and Memory or Space Overhead M.",
