        "text": "Active Checkpoint 1! Ten million sorted US state codes across fifty states have a raw footprint of thirty megabytes and an average run length of two hundred thousand rows, yielding fifty runs. Calculate the Dictionary bit-width b, total compressed bytes using Dictionary plus RLE, and overall compression ratio.",
