        "text": "Databricks compressed one hundred terabytes of raw CSV down to eleven point nine terabytes in Parquet ZSTD, speeding up ninety-nine complex queries by fourteen point two times! Meanwhile, Uber Hudi ingests streaming events into append-friendly Avro delta logs and compacts them asynchronously into 128-megabyte Parquet base files, slashing query planning from forty-five minutes to sub-second!",
