        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Welcome to Lesson 11.5: Weak Supervision: Foundations and Programmatic Labeling. Having mastered human-in-the-loop active querying in Lessons 11.2 through 11.4, we now explore a paradigm shift known as Software 2.0 Data Programming.",
