        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Let us trace the four-stage Weak Supervision pipeline. Domain experts author multi-source Labeling Functions wrapping regexes, distant knowledge bases like Wikidata, and zero-shot prompts. Evaluating them across unlabeled data produces the Sparse Label Matrix Lambda.",
