        "text": "Resilient Distributed Datasets solve this through deterministic lineage graphs. Under Definition 12.4.3, the engine records an immutable directed graph of transformations. If a worker node crashes, the master reconstructs only the lost partition by replaying its upstream ancestor lineage from durable storage.",
