        "text": "Increase the key skew factor alpha to see how a heavy-tailed key distribution creates a straggler reducer that delays the entire stage. Then, click Inject Worker Failure to watch the engine recompute the lost task via lineage in 18 milliseconds, and toggle AQE Skew Mitigation to balance the workload.",
