        "text": "Emerging architectures leverage Compute Express Link—or CXL—to pool petabytes of memory across racks with sub-microsecond latency. Combined with SmartNIC hardware shuffle offloading and GPUDirect RDMA, the historical boundary between local CPU memory and remote cluster storage is dissolving into a unified composable fabric.",
