        "text": "Because in real networks, packets take unpredictable detours! If an edge gateway disconnects in a tunnel for thirty seconds, its timestamps would bunch up at arrival time, making a moving car look like it traveled at supersonic speeds. We must anchor all aggregations in Event Time.",
