        "turnIndex": 0,
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Let's formalize the industry gold standard: Fréchet Inception Distance, introduced by Heusel and colleagues in 2017. We pass real and synthetic samples through the pool3 layer of Inception-v3 to obtain 2048-dimensional feature vectors.",
