        "turnIndex": 1,
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Because human eyes are easily deceived, Kaito! A generator might be suffering from complete mode collapse—memorizing just five gorgeous patients—or omitting rare pathological lesions entirely. Production datasets demand quantitative metrics that decouple individual instance fidelity from global manifold diversity!",
