        "text": "Outstanding analytical derivation! The squared mean difference is 5. The matrix square root has diagonal entries 2 and 6. The trace penalty simplifies to (4 + 1 - 4) plus (9 + 4 - 12), which is 1 plus 1 equals 2. Adding them yields FID squared equals 5 plus 2 equals 7, so FID equals the square root of 7, approximately 2.6458!",
