        "text": "In production, several subtle engineering failures can ruin self-supervised downstream adaptation. Three acute anti-patterns recur across industry: aggressive end-to-end fine-tuning on small target datasets, evaluating with non-convex multi-layer perceptron probes, and omitting pixel patch normalization during MAE pretraining.",
