        "text": "Almost never, Kaito! Stochastic gradient descent is naturally resilient to slight staleness. For machine learning feature stores and streaming telemetry, eventual consistency or read-your-writes session consistency delivers ten times higher throughput with sub-millisecond latencies. Save linearizability for model checkpoint manifests and financial ledgers!",
