        "text": "Because real-time collectors must be lightweight and non-blocking! If our Kafka sink had to execute multi-table deduplication or repartitioning synchronously, a brief database lock would back up our brokers and cause backpressure spikes. Bronze is an immutable raw audit ledger.",
