            "text": "An enterprise medical synthesizer trains for k equals 100 query steps with step parameters epsilon-zero 0.05 and target failure probability delta 10 to the minus 5. Under Rényi DP of order alpha 4.0, total RDP is 1.00. Calculate the converted epsilon under RDP versus classical Advanced Composition, and evaluate whether both satisfy the regulatory threshold of epsilon 3.0.",
