        "text": "Rule 1: Optimize micro-batch windows via Delta t star to balance dispatch overhead against SLA latency. Rule 2: Dynamically batch GPU tensor inferences to eliminate single-item throughput ceilings. Rule 3: Enforce strict quorum intersections and bin-pack files into 512-megabyte blocks. And Rule 4: Deploy statistical process control charts to continuously detect semantic drift. Congratulations on mastering Track 9!",
